<rml>
<head>
	<title>Web (Phase 6 wireframe)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="laptop.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- M2 wireframe of the native laptop (docs/ui/laptop.md). Literal data.
     Generated by tools/ui/phase6_mocks.py: edit the generator, not this file. -->
<body class="lt">
<div class="lt-root">
	<div class="lt-bg"></div>
	<div class="lt-top">
		<div class="lt-os" title="sir-FER 4.0"><img class="icon" src="icon-laptop"/></div>
		<div class="lt-app"><span class="t" id="laptop.title">Web</span><span class="s">I.M.P. · Personality</span></div>
		<div class="lt-stat" id="laptop.date"><span class="k">Day 12</span><span class="v">14:35</span></div>
		<div class="lt-stat" id="laptop.balance"><span class="k">Balance</span><span class="v">$48,250</span></div>
		<div class="lt-stat" id="laptop.team"><span class="k">Team</span><span class="v">9</span></div>
		<button class="icon-btn first-btn" id="laptop.help" title="Help (H)"><img class="icon" src="icon-question"/></button>
		<button class="btn" id="laptop.tomap"><img class="icon" src="icon-map"/><span class="label">Map</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="lt-dock" id="laptop.dock"><div class="app" id="laptop.app.email" title="E-mail (F1)"><img class="icon" src="icon-mail"/><span class="label">E-mail</span><span class="kbd">F1</span><span class="badge info">3</span></div><div class="app active" id="laptop.app.web" title="Web (F2)"><img class="icon" src="icon-globe"/><span class="label">Web</span><span class="kbd">F2</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.finances" title="Finances (F3)"><img class="icon" src="icon-money"/><span class="label">Finances</span><span class="kbd">F3</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.personnel" title="Personnel (F4)"><img class="icon" src="icon-squad"/><span class="label">Personnel</span><span class="kbd">F4</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.history" title="History (F5)"><img class="icon" src="icon-history"/><span class="label">History</span><span class="kbd">F5</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.files" title="Files (F6)"><img class="icon" src="icon-folder"/><span class="label">Files</span><span class="kbd">F6</span><span class="badge info">1</span></div><div class="app off" id="laptop.close" title="Close the laptop and go back to the map (Esc)"><img class="icon" src="icon-power"/><span class="label">Close</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></div></div>
	<div class="lt-win" id="laptop.window">
		<div class="lt-pad" style="padding: 0;"><div class="br">
		<div class="br-bar">
			<button class="icon-btn" id="web.back" title="Back (Alt+Left)"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-left"/></button><button class="icon-btn" id="web.forward" title="Forward (Alt+Right)"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-right"/></button>
			<div class="br-url" id="web.address"><img class="icon" src="icon-lock"/><span class="host">www.imp.com</span><span>/profile/personality</span></div>
			<div class="row grow" id="web.bookmarks"><div class="bm bm-aim" id="web.bookmark.aim"><span class="sw"></span><span>A.I.M.</span></div><div class="bm bm-merc" id="web.bookmark.merc"><span class="sw"></span><span>M.E.R.C.</span></div><div class="bm bm-imp active" id="web.bookmark.imp"><span class="sw"></span><span>I.M.P.</span></div><div class="bm bm-bobby" id="web.bookmark.bobby"><span class="sw"></span><span>Bobby Ray's</span></div><div class="bm bm-florist" id="web.bookmark.florist"><span class="sw"></span><span>Florist</span></div><div class="bm bm-ins" id="web.bookmark.insurance"><span class="sw"></span><span>Insurance</span></div><div class="bm bm-fun" id="web.bookmark.funeral"><span class="sw"></span><span>Mortuary</span></div></div>
		</div>
		<div class="br-page page-imp" id="web.page"><div class="imp"><div class="site-head"><span class="wm">I.M.P.</span><span class="wm-sub">Institute for Mercenary Profiling</span><span class="grow"></span><button class="btn btn-ghost" id="imp.cancel"><img class="icon" src="icon-close"/><span class="label">Cancel</span></button></div>
		<div class="imp-steps" id="imp.steps"><div class="step done"><span class="n">1</span><span>Begin</span></div><div class="step on"><span class="n">2</span><span>Personality</span></div><div class="step "><span class="n">3</span><span>Attributes</span></div><div class="step "><span class="n">4</span><span>Specialties</span></div><div class="step "><span class="n">5</span><span>Portrait</span></div><div class="step "><span class="n">6</span><span>Voice</span></div><div class="step "><span class="n">7</span><span>Finish</span></div></div>
		<div class="quiz">
			<div class="quiz-main">
				<span class="q-no">Question 6 of 16</span><div class="q-prog"><div class="p done"></div><div class="p done"></div><div class="p done"></div><div class="p done"></div><div class="p done"></div><div class="p on"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div><div class="p"></div></div>
				<span class="q-text" id="imp.question">Your squad is pinned down at the edge of town. You have a few seconds to decide. What do you do?</span>
				<div id="imp.answers"><div class="ans" id="imp.answer[0]"><span class="kbd">1</span><span class="t">Stay put and wait for the others to catch up — nobody runs off alone.</span></div><div class="ans on" id="imp.answer[1]"><span class="kbd">2</span><span class="t">Take point. Somebody has to, and I trust myself most.</span><img class="icon" src="icon-ok"/></div><div class="ans" id="imp.answer[2]"><span class="kbd">3</span><span class="t">Hang back and cover the squad from a good firing position.</span></div><div class="ans" id="imp.answer[3]"><span class="kbd">4</span><span class="t">Whatever the leader says. That’s what a chain of command is for.</span></div><div class="ans" id="imp.answer[4]"><span class="kbd">5</span><span class="t">Find the nearest bar. The war will still be there tomorrow.</span></div></div>
				<div class="q-act"><button class="btn" id="imp.prev"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-left"/><span class="label">Previous</span><span class="kbd">Left</span></button><button class="btn btn-ghost" id="imp.restart"><img class="icon" src="icon-reload"/><span class="label">Start over</span></button><span class="grow"></span><button class="btn btn-primary" id="imp.confirm"><img class="icon" src="icon-confirm"/><span class="label">Confirm answer</span><span class="kbd">Enter</span></button></div>
			</div>
			<div class="quiz-side"><div class="panel pad"><span class="section">Your profile</span>
				<div class="kv"><span class="k">Name</span><span class="v">Kat Rourke</span></div>
				<div class="kv"><span class="k">Nickname</span><span class="v">Kat</span></div>
				<div class="kv"><span class="k">Gender</span><span class="v">Female</span></div>
				<div class="kv"><span class="k">Profile fee</span><span class="v">$3,000</span></div>
				<p class="dim" style="display: block; margin-top: 12dp; font-size: 15dp; line-height: 21dp;">There are no right answers. Your answers decide your character’s personality and attitude, which other mercs will react to.</p>
			</div></div>
		</div></div></div>
	</div></div>
		
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
